    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="structastrea_1_1trace_1_1HyperStats" kindref="compound">HyperStats</ref> struct represents statistics of statistics, allowing for the calculation of statistics on a vector of Stats&lt;T&gt;. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It contains Stats&lt;T&gt; for the minimum, maximum, and average values across the input Stats&lt;T&gt; vector, as well as a vector of Stats&lt;T&gt; for each percentile. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
